	| ---- | ---- | 
	| <++> | <++> | 

snippet ttab
	| <++> | <++> | <++> |
	| ---- | ---- | ---- |
	| <++> | <++> | <++> |

snippet quo
	> ${1}

snippet red
	<span style = "color:red">${1:red}</span>

snippet blue
